    "name": {
     "en": "Ōmiya Hachimangū",
     "ja": "大宮八幡宮"
    },
    "about": {
     "en": "Founded by tradition in 1063. On his way to war, Minamoto no Yoriyoshi saw eight bands of white cloud here like Genji banners, and after his victory he brought a spirit from Iwashimizu Hachimangū in Kyoto to found the shrine.",
     "ja": "1063年の創建と伝わる。戦いに向かう途中、この地で源氏の白旗のような八条の白雲を見た源頼義が、凱旋後に京都の石清水八幡宮から勧請した。"
    },
